config BR2_PACKAGE_BTMON
	bool "btmon"
	help
	  bluez's protocol analyzer, alone: the one tool that turns a
	  btsnoop capture into readable HCI/L2CAP/ATT/SMP traffic
	  (btmon -r trace.btsnoop). Built straight from the bluez
	  tarball without configure, so it does not drag in glib2,
	  dbus or bluetoothd -- a ~400 KB compressed add instead of
	  ~4 MB. There is no Bluetooth controller in this machine;
	  offline analysis is the whole point.

	  https://www.bluez.org
